OL,3,GNEWSAReplacement for 1970s student
OL,4,Ablock approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to redevelop former graduate
OL,7,Fhousing into a "high-quality,
OL,8,Fsustainable" new academic centre have
OL,9,Fbeen approved.
OL,11,FThe University of Oxford plans to
OL,12,Fknock-down the existing 1970s-built
OL,13,Fstructure at 25 Wellington Square and
OL,14,Freplace it with a new 65,000 sq ft
OL,15,Fspace.
OL,17,FThe proposals, which were approved by
OL,18,FOxford City Council, also include the
OL,19,Frefurbishment of nearby Victorian
OL,20,Fterrace housing.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
